  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 2.45,
      "end": 7.19,
      "en": "Hello everyone, welcome back to another great lesson here with us at EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "大家好，欢迎回到 Englishpod 的另一个精彩课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 7.52,
      "end": 7.97,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.31,
      "end": 8.91,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 9.43,
      "end": 10.93,
      "en": "And today we're going to be getting money.",
      "zh": "今天我们要赚钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 11.51,
      "end": 11.91,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 12.05,
      "end": 14.37,
      "en": "We're going to have a lesson about the ATM.",
      "zh": "我们将有一个关于自动取款机的课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 14.95,
      "end": 16.43,
      "en": "The ATM or?",
      "zh": "自动取款机还是？"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 17.24,
      "end": 18.24,
      "en": "Automatic Teller Machine.",
      "zh": "自动柜员机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 18.97,
      "end": 20.53,
      "en": "Okay, that's what it stands for, ATM.",
      "zh": "好吧，这就是它所代表的，ATM。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 21.4,
      "end": 29.46,
      "en": "So we're going to be looking at the language that you'll probably find in an ATM maybe in the United States or in English speaking country.",
      "zh": "因此，我们将查看您可能在美国或英语国家的自动取款机中找到的语言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 29.46,
      "end": 30.46,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 30.46,
      "end": 33.85,
      "en": "But before we begin, why don't we look at some vocabulary that we'll hear in the dialogue.",
      "zh": "但在我们开始之前，我们为什么不看看我们将在对话中听到的一些词汇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 35.56,
      "end": 35.89,
      "en": "Vocabulary Preview.",
      "zh": "词汇预习。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 37.22,
      "end": 43.5,
      "en": "As we mentioned, the ATM or Automatic Teller Machine is a machine where you get your money, right?",
      "zh": "正如我们所提到的，自动取款机或自动柜员机是您可以赚钱的机器，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 44.64,
      "end": 45.64,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 45.64,
      "end": 49.2,
      "en": "And also, well, some people are in different places, they may call it the bank machine.",
      "zh": "而且，好吧，有些人在不同的地方，他们可能称之为银行机器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 49.22,
      "end": 50.96,
      "en": "Yeah, or maybe the cash machine.",
      "zh": "是的，或者可能是取款机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 51.8,
      "end": 54.28,
      "en": "Or just a money machine or something.",
      "zh": "或者只是一台钱机什么的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 54.52,
      "end": 54.74,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 55.28,
      "end": 55.64,
      "en": "So ATM.",
      "zh": "所以自动取款机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 56.28,
      "end": 57.28,
      "en": "ATM.",
      "zh": "自动取款机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 57.28,
      "end": 60.28,
      "en": "And now let's take a look at our next word.",
      "zh": "现在让我们来看看我们的下一个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 60.28,
      "end": 60.63,
      "en": "Local Authorities.",
      "zh": "地方当局。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 61.68,
      "end": 62.81,
      "en": "The Local Authorities.",
      "zh": "地方当局。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 63.08,
      "end": 63.91,
      "en": "The Local Authorities.",
      "zh": "地方当局。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 64.56,
      "end": 65.99,
      "en": "So what are the Local Authorities?",
      "zh": "那么地方当局是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 66.49,
      "end": 67.95,
      "en": "Well, basically, it's the police.",
      "zh": "好吧，基本上，这是警察。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 68.25,
      "end": 68.61,
      "en": "The police.",
      "zh": "警察。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 69.15,
      "end": 70.39,
      "en": "Why do you say local authorities?",
      "zh": "为什么说地方当局？"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 70.63,
      "end": 74.45,
      "en": "Okay, well, authority is the person in charge, right?",
      "zh": "好吧，权威是负责人，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 74.68,
      "end": 74.95,
      "en": "The boss.",
      "zh": "老板。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 75.45,
      "end": 79.73,
      "en": "So the local authorities are basically the people who are the boss of this place.",
      "zh": "所以地方当局基本上是这个地方的老板。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 79.99,
      "end": 80.53,
      "en": "In that area.",
      "zh": "在那个地区。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 80.71,
      "end": 80.83,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 82.08,
      "end": 83.08,
      "en": "So the police.",
      "zh": "于是警察。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 83.08,
      "end": 84.08,
      "en": "The local authorities.",
      "zh": "地方当局。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 84.08,
      "end": 85.58,
      "en": "So why don't we start now with our dialogue?",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不现在从我们的对话开始呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 86.02,
      "end": 88.82,
      "en": "Why are we talking about local authorities and ATM machines?",
      "zh": "为什么我们谈论地方当局和自动取款机？"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 89.26,
      "end": 89.5,
      "en": "I don't know.",
      "zh": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 90.24,
      "end": 106.08,
      "en": "We got to listen to find out.",
      "zh": "我们得听听。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 106.08,
      "end": 108.56,
      "en": "Stupid girl making me spend so much money.",
      "zh": "那个臭丫头，害我花这么多钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 108.56,
      "end": 109.5,
      "en": "Now I have to get it from the ATM.",
      "zh": "现在还得去自动取款机取钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 110.8,
      "end": 114.04,
      "en": "Hello, welcome to Universal Bank.",
      "zh": "您好，欢迎来到环球银行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 114.04,
      "end": 115.71,
      "en": "Please insert your card into the slot.",
      "zh": "请将您的卡插入插槽。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 115.92,
      "end": 116.85,
      "en": "I know where to put my card.",
      "zh": "我知道把我的卡放在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 117.27,
      "end": 119.13,
      "en": "Stupid machine talking to me like I'm an idiot.",
      "zh": "破机器，说话的口气好像我是什么都不懂的傻瓜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 119.65,
      "end": 123.25,
      "en": "Please input your six digit PIN code followed by the pound key.",
      "zh": "请输入六位密码，然后按井号键。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 123.79,
      "end": 124.33,
      "en": "Thank you.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 124.81,
      "end": 125.83,
      "en": "Please select an option.",
      "zh": "请选择一个选项。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 126.63,
      "end": 127.03,
      "en": "Thank you.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 127.84,
      "end": 128.97,
      "en": "You have selected withdraw.",
      "zh": "您选择了取款。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 129.35,
      "end": 131.29,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah, I know what I selected.",
      "zh": "是的，是的，我知道我选择了什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 131.73,
      "end": 132.53,
      "en": "Just give me my money.",
      "zh": "快把钱给我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 133.01,
      "end": 135.11,
      "en": "Please type the amount you would like to withdraw.",
      "zh": "请输入您要提取的金额。"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 138.52,
      "end": 139.24,
      "en": "Thank you.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 139.56,
      "end": 140.4,
      "en": "You want to transfer.",
      "zh": "您要转账。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 141.06,
      "end": 146.84,
      "en": "10,000 US dollars to the World Wildlife Foundation.",
      "zh": "向世界自然基金会转账一万美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 146.84,
      "end": 148.76,
      "en": "If this is correct, please press one.",
      "zh": "如确认无误，请按一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 148.76,
      "end": 150.12,
      "en": "No, no, stupid machine.",
      "zh": "不，不，破机器！"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 150.52,
      "end": 150.92,
      "en": "What are you doing?",
