      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "start": 193.44,
      "end": 198.88,
      "en": "So well, we saw some of the language that was related to an ATM, money and banking.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们看到了一些与 ATM、货币和银行业务相关的语言。"
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 198.88,
      "end": 204.24,
      "en": "So why don't we take a look at that now in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "那么，我们为什么不现在在语言外卖中看看呢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 204.24,
      "end": 205.24,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 205.24,
      "end": 207.12,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 207.12,
      "end": 210.68,
      "en": "So the guy had to insert his card into the slot.",
      "zh": "所以那个人不得不将他的卡片插入插槽。"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 211.2,
      "end": 211.54,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 211.6,
      "end": 212.78,
      "en": "So slot.",
