      "start": 500.52,
      "end": 500.79,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 501.19,
      "end": 502.21,
      "en": "So what else can we insert?",
      "zh": "那么我们还能插入什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 502.59,
      "end": 506.11,
      "en": "Well, for example, commonly you insert a disc.",
      "zh": "好吧，例如，您通常插入光盘。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 506.59,
      "end": 507.25,
      "en": "Yeah, in your computer.",
      "zh": "是的，在你的电脑里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 507.51,
      "end": 508.33,
      "en": "In your computer, right?",
      "zh": "在你的电脑上，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 508.6,
      "end": 509.6,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 509.6,
      "end": 512.89,
      "en": "Or you insert a CD into your CD player.",
      "zh": "或者您将 CD 插入 CD 播放器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 513.44,
      "end": 514.89,
      "en": "Or DVD into your DVD player.",
      "zh": "或者把 DVD 放进 DVD 播放机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 515.16,
      "end": 516.16,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 516.16,
      "end": 517.16,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 517.16,
      "end": 518.72,
      "en": "So to insert something, to put inside.",
      "zh": "所以插入一些东西，把里面放进去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 518.72,
      "end": 519.72,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 519.72,
      "end": 523.1,
      "en": "So he had to insert his card into the slot.",
      "zh": "所以他不得不把他的卡插入插槽。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 523.8,
      "end": 528.04,
      "en": "And then the bank machine asked him to select an option.",
      "zh": "然后银行机器要求他选择一个选项。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 529.24,
      "end": 529.86,
      "en": "Select an option.",
      "zh": "选择一个选项。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 530.4,
      "end": 530.78,
      "en": "Select an option.",
      "zh": "选择一个选项。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 531.4,
      "end": 538.12,
      "en": "Now this is a very common phrase that you will not only see in ATMs, but basically everywhere, right?",
      "zh": "现在这是一个非常常见的短语，您不仅会在自动取款机中看到，而且基本上在任何地方都可以看到，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 538.12,
      "end": 542.92,
      "en": "On computers or the internet or many, many things where you're dealing with machines.",
      "zh": "在计算机或互联网上或许多很多事情上，您正在与机器打交道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 542.92,
      "end": 547.45,
      "en": "So it's an order that says, well, select one of these choices that you have.",
      "zh": "所以这是一个订单，说，好吧，选择你拥有的这些选择之一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 547.84,
      "end": 548.11,
      "en": "Make a choice.",
      "zh": "做出选择。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 548.84,
      "end": 549.84,
      "en": "Make a choice.",
      "zh": "做出选择。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 549.84,
      "end": 550.84,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 550.84,
      "end": 551.84,
      "en": "Select an option.",
      "zh": "选择一个选项。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 551.84,
      "end": 552.84,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 552.84,
      "end": 556.39,
      "en": "So two simple phrases, but very useful and also very high frequency, right?",
      "zh": "所以两个简单的短语，但非常有用而且频率很高，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 556.72,
      "end": 556.85,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 556.87,
      "end": 557.41,
      "en": "And you know what?",
      "zh": "而且你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 557.59,
      "end": 561.41,
      "en": "When you use phrases like these two, it sounds quite professional, doesn't it?",
      "zh": "当你使用这两个词组时，听起来很专业，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 561.63,
      "end": 561.77,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 561.83,
      "end": 562.73,
      "en": "A little bit formal.",
      "zh": "有点正式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 563.76,
      "end": 564.76,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 564.76,
      "end": 568.17,
      "en": "So why don't we listen to our dialogue for the last time and then we'll come back and talk a little bit more.",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不最后一次听我们的对话，然后我们会回来多说一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 580.48,
      "end": 582.17,
      "en": "Stupid girl making me spend so much money.",
      "zh": "那个臭丫头，害我花这么多钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 582.96,
      "end": 583.91,
      "en": "Now I have to get it from the ATM.",
      "zh": "现在还得去自动取款机取钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 585.0,
      "end": 586.0,
      "en": "Hello.",
      "zh": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 586.35,
      "end": 587.63,
      "en": "Welcome to Universal Bank.",
      "zh": "欢迎来到环球银行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 588.15,
      "end": 590.09,
      "en": "Please insert your card into the slot.",
      "zh": "请将您的卡插入插槽。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 590.29,
      "end": 591.23,
      "en": "I know where to put my card.",
      "zh": "我知道把我的卡放在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 591.65,
      "end": 593.51,
      "en": "Stupid machine talking to me like I'm an idiot.",
      "zh": "破机器，说话的口气好像我是什么都不懂的傻瓜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 594.03,
      "end": 597.65,
      "en": "Please input your six digit PIN code followed by the pound key.",
      "zh": "请输入六位密码，然后按井号键。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 598.11,
      "end": 598.73,
      "en": "Thank you.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 599.21,
      "end": 600.23,
      "en": "Please select an option.",
      "zh": "请选择一个选项。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 600.99,
      "end": 601.41,
      "en": "Thank you.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 602.24,
      "end": 603.35,
      "en": "You have selected withdraw.",
      "zh": "您选择了取款。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 603.75,
      "end": 604.17,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 604.47,
      "end": 605.55,
      "en": "I know what I selected.",
      "zh": "我知道我选择了什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 606.13,
      "end": 606.93,
      "en": "Just give me my money.",
      "zh": "快把钱给我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 607.37,
      "end": 609.47,
      "en": "Please type the amount you would like to withdraw.",
      "zh": "请输入您要提取的金额。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 612.88,
      "end": 613.64,
      "en": "Thank you.",
      "zh": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 614.44,
      "end": 620.24,
      "en": "You want to transfer $10,000 to the World Wildlife Foundation.",
      "zh": "您想将 10,000 美元转移到世界野生动物基金会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 621.2,
      "end": 623.2,
      "en": "If this is correct, please press one.",
      "zh": "如确认无误，请按一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 623.2,
      "end": 623.66,
      "en": "No, no.",
      "zh": "不，不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 624.2,
      "end": 624.5,
      "en": "Stupid machine.",
      "zh": "愚蠢的机器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 625.2,
      "end": 626.2,
      "en": "What are you doing?",
      "zh": "你在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 626.2,
      "end": 627.2,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 627.2,
      "end": 628.2,
      "en": "Confirmed.",
      "zh": "已确认。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 628.2,
      "end": 628.6,
      "en": "Thank you for using our bank.",
      "zh": "感谢您使用本行的服务。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 629.2,
      "end": 630.8,
      "en": "Please remove your card from the slot.",
      "zh": "请从卡槽取走您的卡。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 631.36,
      "end": 631.5,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 632.02,
      "end": 632.68,
      "en": "No way.",
      "zh": "不会吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 633.12,
      "end": 633.38,
      "en": "What happened?",
      "zh": "发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 633.9,
      "end": 634.56,
      "en": "Give me my money.",
      "zh": "把钱给我。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 635.83,
      "end": 636.35,
      "en": "Danger.",
      "zh": "危险。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 636.4,
      "end": 637.4,
      "en": "Danger.",
      "zh": "危险。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 637.81,
      "end": 643.01,
      "en": "The exits have been sealed and the doors will remain locked until the local authorities arrive.",
      "zh": "出口已封锁，当地执法人员到达前，大门将保持锁闭。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 643.59,
      "end": 644.73,
      "en": "Thank you for using our bank.",
      "zh": "感谢您使用本行的服务。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 645.21,
      "end": 645.91,
      "en": "Have a nice day.",
      "zh": "祝你今天愉快。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 646.03,
      "end": 646.25,
      "en": "No.",
      "zh": "不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 652.91,
      "end": 654.85,
      "en": "All right, Erica, so what about you?",
      "zh": "好吧，艾丽卡，那你呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 655.04,
      "end": 657.07,
      "en": "Have you ever had any problems with the ATM?",
      "zh": "你有过自动取款机的问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 657.77,
      "end": 659.77,
      "en": "I've had more problems than I can count.",
      "zh": "我遇到的问题超出了我的数。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 660.35,
      "end": 660.93,
      "en": "What happened?",
      "zh": "发生什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 661.33,
      "end": 666.11,
      "en": "Well, I think in the last two years, I've probably lost about seven bank cards in an ATM.",
      "zh": "好吧，我想在过去的两年里，我可能在自动取款机上丢失了大约七张银行卡。"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 666.43,
      "end": 666.67,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 666.95,
      "end": 668.43,
      "en": "You forget it in the slot?",
      "zh": "你忘了在插槽里吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 668.88,
      "end": 669.88,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 669.88,
      "end": 674.4,
      "en": "I leave it in the slot and then walk away from the bank machine and no bank cards.",
      "zh": "我把它留在插槽里，然后离开银行机器，没有银行卡。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 674.71,
      "end": 686.25,
      "en": "Well, I think now the ATMs, because this is a common problem, now they have like a little alarm that when you take out your money and everything, it just starts beeping and beeping until you take out your card.",
      "zh": "好吧，我认为现在的自动取款机，因为这是一个常见的问题，现在它们就像一个小警报，当你拿出你的钱和所有东西时，它只是开始发出哔哔声和哔哔声，直到你取出你的卡片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 686.49,
      "end": 686.67,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 686.67,
      "end": 691.57,
      "en": "And I like the bank machines that actually give you your card first and then give you your money.",
      "zh": "我喜欢先给你卡然后给你钱的银行机器。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 692.16,
      "end": 694.27,
      "en": "Because if they give me my money first, that's all I want, right?",
      "zh": "因为如果他们先给我钱，这就是我想要的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 694.6,
      "end": 696.99,
      "en": "So I run away with my money and leave my card in the bank machine.",
      "zh": "所以我带着我的钱逃跑，把我的卡留在银行机器里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 697.75,
      "end": 698.15,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 698.17,
      "end": 699.21,
      "en": "I think that's a good idea.",
      "zh": "我认为这是个好主意。"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 699.53,
      "end": 701.13,
      "en": "I've never seen it before, though.",
      "zh": "不过，我以前从未见过它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 701.44,
      "end": 703.0,
      "en": "In Switzerland, they have them like that.",
      "zh": "在瑞士，他们有这样的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 321,
      "start": 703.0,
      "end": 704.0,
      "en": "In Switzerland.",
      "zh": "在瑞士。"
    },
    {
      "id": 322,
      "start": 704.0,
      "end": 706.8,
      "en": "And I think it's the ATMs that you only have to swipe your card.",
      "zh": "而且我认为这是您只需刷卡的自动取款机。"
    },
    {
      "id": 323,
      "start": 706.96,
      "end": 707.14,
      "en": "Oh, yeah.",
      "zh": "哦，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 324,
      "start": 707.2,
      "end": 709.82,
      "en": "I've done that as well and also ruined a bank card with that.",
      "zh": "我也这样做了，也用它毁了一张银行卡。"
    },
    {
      "id": 325,
      "start": 710.24,
      "end": 713.88,
      "en": "I swiped it too many times, put in the wrong pin code and...",
      "zh": "我刷了太多次，输入错误的PIN码和..."
    },
    {
      "id": 326,
      "start": 713.88,
      "end": 714.62,
      "en": "It blocked your card.",
      "zh": "它封锁了你的卡。"
    },
    {
      "id": 327,
      "start": 714.88,
      "end": 715.88,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 328,
      "start": 715.88,
      "end": 716.88,
      "en": "Terrible.",
      "zh": "可怕的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 329,
      "start": 716.88,
      "end": 717.34,
      "en": "Well, what about you guys?",
      "zh": "嗯，你们呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 330,
      "start": 717.88,
      "end": 722.48,
      "en": "I'm sure everyone has some experience or some inconvenience with ATM machines.",
      "zh": "我相信每个人都有一些经验或对 ATM 机器的不便。"
    },
    {
      "id": 331,
      "start": 723.08,
      "end": 725.3,
      "en": "So why don't you come to our website and tell us all about it?",
      "zh": "那么你为什么不来我们的网站告诉我们所有的事情呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 332,
      "start": 725.56,
      "end": 730.7,
      "en": "You can also find lots more resources on our website to help you learn English.",
      "zh": "您还可以在我们的网站上找到更多资源来帮助您学习英语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 333,
      "start": 731.02,
      "end": 731.8,
      "en": "So check it out.",
      "zh": "那么来看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 334,
      "start": 731.8,
      "end": 734.28,
      "en": "And until next time, goodbye!",
      "zh": "直到下一次，再见！"
    }
  ],
